<title>UK: ABN AMRO SETS WARRANTS ON ROYAL DUTCH.</title>
<headline>ABN AMRO SETS WARRANTS ON ROYAL DUTCH.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN Amro Hoare Govett said it will issue three million American-style call warrants, on Royal Dutch Petroleum Co on Wednesday, August 13.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    125 NLG		   PREMIUM	16.65 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     19.05 NLG (INDIC)     GEARING	6.0 X</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 14.AUG.97-30.JUN.99   PAYDATE</p>
<p> LISTING	   AEX EXCHANGES	   MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  114.40 NLG</p>
<p> NOTES	    </p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
